# Godot 4
.godot/
*.import
export_presets.cfg
*.translation

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode/
*.swp

# Reference material (personal photos/sketches — likeness truth, never edited
# directly) and input (vendor/found source assets meant to be cut, remixed,
# or composited into final art — or fresh, not-yet-reviewed generated output —
# not currently being actively worked on), wherever they live under assets/.
# Every family's reference/ and input/ folders (see CLAUDE.md's "Where things
# live") are excluded except their own folder structure, tracked via
# .gitkeep/.gdignore, so Godot's editor also skips scanning them. Actual media
# files stay untracked until the Git LFS decision is made (see
# docs/PRODUCTION_ROADMAP.md).
# 2026-08-14: renamed from material/ to input/ — same lifecycle stage, clearer
# name (see CLAUDE.md's "Where things live", GitHub issue #20).
assets/**/reference/**
assets/**/input/**
!assets/**/reference/**/
!assets/**/input/**/
!assets/**/reference/**/.gitkeep
!assets/**/input/**/.gitkeep
!assets/**/reference/**/.gdignore
!assets/**/input/**/.gdignore

# wip/ folders ARE tracked by default — that's the point, it's the shared
# handoff point with Lillian for in-progress art. Only specific oversized
# third-party packs below are carved out as an exception, for size/LFS
# reasons independent of which lifecycle bucket they landed in.
# 2026-08-13: these packs moved out of the old flat assets/thirdparty/ into
# their new per-family reference/input/wip homes as part of the same
# restructure; the size-based ignore rule travels with them (see CLAUDE.md's
# "Where things live", GitHub issue #20). Provenance/license terms are
# recorded in docs/ASSET_LICENSES.md regardless of whether the raw files are
# committed. The small packs (bitglow, rgsdev, 0x72_dungeon_tileset_ii,
# pet_cats_pack, basic_asset_pack) predate/are exempt from this rule and stay
# tracked as before.
assets/environments/input/limezu_modern_interiors_full/
assets/environments/input/limezu_modern_exteriors/
assets/environments/input/limezu_serene_village/
assets/environments/input/0x72_industrial_tileset/
assets/environments/input/superretroworld_interior_pack/
assets/ui/input/kenney_ui_pack/
assets/ui/input/kenney_fantasy_ui_borders/
